(2591705, 359327, 5885, '<td valign="top">With the amount of noise in this image, I think the frame should have been excluded. The smooth frame against the grain of the image feels unnatural.<br/> <br/>Overall, the image looks good though and I love the composition and love the post-process, I think it adds to the grain.</td>', 'With the amount of noise in this image, I think the frame should have been excluded. The smooth frame against the grain of the image feels unnatural. Overall, the image looks good though and I love the composition and love the post-process, I think it adds to the grain.', '2006-07-06 02:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
