(2595540, 358689, 13688, '<td valign="top">This looks really interesting, much more so than most of the bigger boys.  I wish it was lit off in a dark field, and you were slightly farther back so we could have seen more of it.</td>', 'This looks really interesting, much more so than most of the bigger boys.  I wish it was lit off in a dark field, and you were slightly farther back so we could have seen more of it.', '2006-07-07 00:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595655, 359314, 13688, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp and well exposed.  The composition is uncomfortable for me with the monument''s focal pt and the firework being so far from each other.  Would have been funny as a "10" submission.</td>', 'Nice and crisp and well exposed.  The composition is uncomfortable for me with the monument''s focal pt and the firework being so far from each other.  Would have been funny as a "10" submission.', '2006-07-07 01:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595683, 358998, 27164, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I love how you included the crowd!  Great successfull wide-angle view.  I predict a ribbon for sure.</td>', 'Awesome!  I love how you included the crowd!  Great successfull wide-angle view.  I predict a ribbon for sure.', '2006-07-07 01:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595702, 359310, 27164, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  First of all, great use of selective desaturation.  And second of all, great creative take on the challenge!  Definitely not like all of the other hundreds of cliche shots.  I suspect a ribbon here for incredible creativity and execution.</td>', 'Awesome!  First of all, great use of selective desaturation.  And second of all, great creative take on the challenge!  Definitely not like all of the other hundreds of cliche shots.  I suspect a ribbon here for incredible creativity and execution.', '2006-07-07 01:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595707, 359142, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the color and the inclusion of the crowd - they definitely add a lot to the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the color and the inclusion of the crowd - they definitely add a lot to the photo.', '2006-07-07 01:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595713, 359331, 48228, '<td valign="top">Stunning image here, well done, as I think it will be placed very high, which it deserves..... I give you a "10".....</td>', 'Stunning image here, well done, as I think it will be placed very high, which it deserves..... I give you a "10".....', '2006-07-07 01:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2595714, 358776, 27164, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I love the strong reds here and the beautiful reflections in the water.  I also love how you can see distant city buildings through the hazy smoke.  Perhaps the contrast could have been boosted a bit more.  Overall a very successful photograph that should do well - I suspect top ten for sure.  Good luck :)</td>', 'This is great.  I love the strong reds here and the beautiful reflections in the water.  I also love how you can see distant city buildings through the hazy smoke.  Perhaps the contrast could have been boosted a bit more.  Overall a very successful photograph that should do well - I suspect top ten for sure.  Good luck :)', '2006-07-07 01:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
