(2597164, 358649, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . ..I love this one!!   It has that nostalgic look I love so much!   It stands out in this challenge!  10</td>', 'Awwwww. . ..I love this one!!   It has that nostalgic look I love so much!   It stands out in this challenge!  10', '2006-07-07 12:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
