(2598583, 359068, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this very much. The lighting in the clouds is super. There are some focus issues which distract me. In proper focus, this would have been a 10. Still giving it a good score.</td>', 'I like the concept of this very much. The lighting in the clouds is super. There are some focus issues which distract me. In proper focus, this would have been a 10. Still giving it a good score.', '2006-07-07 19:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
