(2598593, 359189, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done. Very good capture of colors (possibly best in challenge). I would have given you an extra point if you had leveled the horizon. And I think another extra point if I could see the whole burst.</td>', 'Well done. Very good capture of colors (possibly best in challenge). I would have given you an extra point if you had leveled the horizon. And I think another extra point if I could see the whole burst.', '2006-07-07 19:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2598614, 359160, 18197, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the context of the bay better than just showing a burst. In a weird way it looks like a scene from Blade Runner. The burst on the right is a bit blown out which is a bit distracting. And the horizon is tilted. Without those distractions, this would be a 10. Still worth a very good score.</td>', 'Well done. I like the context of the bay better than just showing a burst. In a weird way it looks like a scene from Blade Runner. The burst on the right is a bit blown out which is a bit distracting. And the horizon is tilted. Without those distractions, this would be a 10. Still worth a very good score.', '2006-07-07 19:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
