(2617153, 358801, 35274, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here, and the little girl. i wish the foregrownd has a bit more focus on it, but this is still very nicely done.</td>', 'I love the composition here, and the little girl. i wish the foregrownd has a bit more focus on it, but this is still very nicely done.', '2006-07-13 00:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
