(2619646, 359334, 12750, '<td valign="top">The Bell South tower does it for me.  Gives size and height to the exploding firework. And the street colors down below glow very well.  Then again you did pick a very good time to take a fireworks shot with the blue above and showers below.  Once again excellent capture.</td>', 'The Bell South tower does it for me.  Gives size and height to the exploding firework. And the street colors down below glow very well.  Then again you did pick a very good time to take a fireworks shot with the blue above and showers below.  Once again excellent capture.', '2006-07-13 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2619654, 359005, 12750, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by maestro:</b></div><hr/><i> I loved the "disolve" on this particular shot at 100%. I think it makes it look like a drawing. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think you are exactly right! And the reason this photo definately appeals to me. Kudos for attempting to be different and succeeding well.</td>', 'Originally posted by maestro: I loved the "disolve" on this particular shot at 100%. I think it makes it look like a drawing.   I think you are exactly right! And the reason this photo definately appeals to me. Kudos for attempting to be different and succeeding well.', '2006-07-13 17:50:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2619664, 359304, 12750, '<td valign="top">Whats funny is, this is a real fireworks shot. NOT wheat or plant or etc.  Mel captured it so unique many did not know the whole shot was of fireworks, not just the fire.</td>', 'Whats funny is, this is a real fireworks shot. NOT wheat or plant or etc.  Mel captured it so unique many did not know the whole shot was of fireworks, not just the fire.', '2006-07-13 17:52:16.000000', NULL, 0),
