(2620410, 358708, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/> <br/>You had a great time at the fireworks, didn''t you?  Congrats on yet another new picture on the top row!  The colors here are great and the focus quite crisp.  And yes, I can see the star - very cool!  Only thing I can see to change is a very minor stray white bit at the bottom that could be cloned - and that''s really a very minor nitpick.  Lovely choice for the challenge!</td>', 'Trading Post comment You had a great time at the fireworks, didn''t you?  Congrats on yet another new picture on the top row!  The colors here are great and the focus quite crisp.  And yes, I can see the star - very cool!  Only thing I can see to change is a very minor stray white bit at the bottom that could be cloned - and that''s really a very minor nitpick.  Lovely choice for the challenge!', '2006-07-13 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2620413, 358714, 6349, '<td valign="top">congrats on the making the front page.  great shot.</td>', 'congrats on the making the front page.  great shot.', '2006-07-13 22:21:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2620429, 359334, 38455, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  I work for Bellsouth and enjoyed seeing the "Bat Building".</td>', 'Very cool shot.  I work for Bellsouth and enjoyed seeing the "Bat Building".', '2006-07-13 22:27:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2620438, 358822, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment:<br/> <br/>Composition is really nice here, giving the scene and the fireworks burst a solid "base".  I also like that the burst isn''t all in the frame, though I can''t tell you why I like it that way.  You may want to try levels to darken the sky just a bit more to give it a bit more punch.</td>', 'Trading Post comment: Composition is really nice here, giving the scene and the fireworks burst a solid "base".  I also like that the burst isn''t all in the frame, though I can''t tell you why I like it that way.  You may want to try levels to darken the sky just a bit more to give it a bit more punch.', '2006-07-13 22:28:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2620467, 359293, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment:<br/> <br/>For a "I don''t know what I''m doing" shot, this finished pretty darn well.  I think the simple, balanced composition, the crisp colors, and the very clean lines create a very pleasing picture of fireworks, but what sealed the deal was the red center in the green burst and how well that complimented the other burst.  Good job with the PP, too.</td>', 'Trading Post comment: For a "I don''t know what I''m doing" shot, this finished pretty darn well.  I think the simple, balanced composition, the crisp colors, and the very clean lines create a very pleasing picture of fireworks, but what sealed the deal was the red center in the green burst and how well that complimented the other burst.  Good job with the PP, too.', '2006-07-13 22:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2620491, 358998, 18339, '<td valign="top">This is such an awsome picture I keep coming back to look at it.  Congratulations :)</td>', 'This is such an awsome picture I keep coming back to look at it.  Congratulations :)', '2006-07-13 22:49:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2620610, 359314, 43312, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the helpful comments.  This was my best photo in the series.  I too wish the fireworks would have been higher.  Since this was my first time to DC to see the firework display, I know where I want to be next year.</td>', 'Thanks for all the helpful comments.  This was my best photo in the series.  I too wish the fireworks would have been higher.  Since this was my first time to DC to see the firework display, I know where I want to be next year.', '2006-07-13 23:21:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2620658, 358822, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Nice shot! I gave this a 6 in voting. I love the purple colors and the little bit of land you have showing. I thought all the fireworks shots were great.</td>', 'Trading post...   Nice shot! I gave this a 6 in voting. I love the purple colors and the little bit of land you have showing. I thought all the fireworks shots were great.', '2006-07-13 23:32:11.000000', NULL, 0),
