(2620753, 358051, 60862, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot!<br/> <br/>First, because you actually made something.  I mean, the other bazillion entries really found good ways to capture something other people created, but you had an original idea.<br/> <br/>Second, because I think it''s an attractive shot.  Some of those sparks on the left look like little bugs flying away.</td>', 'I like this a lot! First, because you actually made something.  I mean, the other bazillion entries really found good ways to capture something other people created, but you had an original idea. Second, because I think it''s an attractive shot.  Some of those sparks on the left look like little bugs flying away.', '2006-07-13 23:48:29.000000', NULL, 0),
