(2628630, 358691, 60862, '<td valign="top">I really like the firework a lot.  I think the trees (bushes) distract from it, though.<br/> <br/>Obviously, you can''t retake it, but try to think about that as you take future shots.  The bushes obscure the lower right extremes of the starburst.  You could use the house behind the bushes to convey a sense of scale to the burst.<br/> <br/>However, you <i>can</i> try editing them out.  Or at least burning them so they''re not so visible.<br/> <br/>But regardless, you should feel lucky you get such a great view at home! :)</td>', 'I really like the firework a lot.  I think the trees (bushes) distract from it, though. Obviously, you can''t retake it, but try to think about that as you take future shots.  The bushes obscure the lower right extremes of the starburst.  You could use the house behind the bushes to convey a sense of scale to the burst. However, you can try editing them out.  Or at least burning them so they''re not so visible. But regardless, you should feel lucky you get such a great view at home! :)', '2006-07-17 02:33:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2630627, 359310, 50466, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one. I was hoping it would score higher.</td>', 'I really liked this one. I was hoping it would score higher.', '2006-07-17 17:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2630795, 359304, 60027, '<td valign="top">This was a shot of real fireworks.  I gave it a unique title, and thought it would be more obvious that it was not wheat.  But...I guess that says good things about my naming/editing skills.  :)  Thanks to all who voted on this.<br/></td>', 'This was a shot of real fireworks.  I gave it a unique title, and thought it would be more obvious that it was not wheat.  But...I guess that says good things about my naming/editing skills.  :)  Thanks to all who voted on this.', '2006-07-17 18:25:17.000000', NULL, 0),
